    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You have five specialties: hefting barrels, drinking, polishing steins, drinking, and drinking. You worked in a bar, where you learned how to hold your liquor and rowdily socialize.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Alcohol Lore skill. You gain the Hobnobber skill feat."
